Adds classic_spl_weekly_scheduled, which the weekly schedule will run.

	•	Gate notebook (classic_spl_weekly_gate): sets end_date to last Saturday (Central), checks the eltv data is refreshed and that the week isn't already scored, and returns run and end_date.
	•	If run is true, it invokes classic_spl_weekly_scoring_pipeline with that end_date. It sends an email if the gate or the scoring fails.
	•	Variable library: added scoring_workspace_id and scoring_pipeline_id with STG and DATA values, so the invoke points to the DATA pipeline after promotion.

Tested: STG scored 11/07 and then skipped on the rerun. In DATA, the invoke used the DATA workspace and pipeline IDs, and all steps succeeded.

Notes: I deployed to DATA before opening this PR so I could test the promotion.
